        "title": "Substitute Values",
        "text": "$$\\sin 2A = 2 \\cdot \\frac{4}{5} \\cdot \\left(-\\frac{3}{5}\\right)$$\n$$= 2 \\cdot \\frac{4 \\times (-3)}{5 \\times 5}$$\n$$= 2 \\cdot \\frac{-12}{25}$$",
